{"steam_appid":1262460,"steam_name":"Zompiercer","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1262460/682781/e1a19fdacdc49740af8221ab6a173c487e7a7b70/1750657183/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1712170817","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257013001/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1712170817","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/1af9ea68bea8e9af5af1e4c6df71e579484f7b96/ss_1af9ea68bea8e9af5af1e4c6df71e579484f7b96.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771504324","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/ss_81335b7acf352c2ab2a80a79f29293ab76d89b30.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771504324","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/6b4c4fb0a26bf9f8430e70acfedf03a94fa7aae8/ss_6b4c4fb0a26bf9f8430e70acfedf03a94fa7aae8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771504324","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/fa40c8e0cdcd4b38307a4791dd5987f71a1c5bd7/ss_fa40c8e0cdcd4b38307a4791dd5987f71a1c5bd7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771504324","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/ss_5dd37a80f1c7fa89d753719037920c6cdf2cca84.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771504324"],"about_the_game":"Take control of the train which will become your haven on the rails. Collect resources, craft equipment, construct a cozy house on railway cars, and travel through the carefully handcrafted locations to explore the story of a zombie apocalypse world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><strong>Take control of the train</strong> which will become your haven on the rails. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/f8da62259ed3c2897b8bec44f0b3ae8a.poster.avif?t=1771504324\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/f8da62259ed3c2897b8bec44f0b3ae8a.webm?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/f8da62259ed3c2897b8bec44f0b3ae8a.mp4?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore the story</strong> by traveling through the extensive and carefully handcrafted locations where each of which will require you to overcome some specific challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/8d0e4e6aee914b6fb0b6e91e6c711c2b.poster.avif?t=1771504324\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/8d0e4e6aee914b6fb0b6e91e6c711c2b.webm?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/8d0e4e6aee914b6fb0b6e91e6c711c2b.mp4?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Find a robotic companion.</strong> Equip your robot with combat and support equipment to make your adventures easier.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/209877deab5608a7350b02fce69f1cb9.poster.avif?t=1771504324\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/209877deab5608a7350b02fce69f1cb9.webm?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/209877deab5608a7350b02fce69f1cb9.mp4?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Construct a home on railway cars.</strong> Various workbenches, storage containers, dozens of decoration elements, and the possibility to place any inventory item on any surface, will allow you to unleash your creativity and build a cozy mobile house that will keep you safe from the dangers of the outer world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/43fce0e4bd791e4957f1daad40201fb5.poster.avif?t=1771504324\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/43fce0e4bd791e4957f1daad40201fb5.webm?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/43fce0e4bd791e4957f1daad40201fb5.mp4?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/4edb330bdf8c9e765b0d1b1f871b59b5.poster.avif?t=1771504324\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/4edb330bdf8c9e765b0d1b1f871b59b5.webm?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/4edb330bdf8c9e765b0d1b1f871b59b5.mp4?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight against a horde of various zombies.</strong> Each type of zombie has its own behavior, tactics, strengths, and weakness. Loot and craft different weapons to improve your survival capabilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/98a92faa98cb867712dcaba532e0e01a.poster.avif?t=1771504324\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/98a92faa98cb867712dcaba532e0e01a.webm?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262460/extras/98a92faa98cb867712dcaba532e0e01a.mp4?t=1771504324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 Ghz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB Dedicated Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 23 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Sound Card: DirectX® Compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 Ghz Quad Core CPU or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB Dedicated Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 23 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Sound Card: DirectX® Compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["DDDimanN"],"publishers":["DDDimanN"],"release_date":"Apr 3, 2020"}